o-bg\"></div>\n  <div class=\"hs-hero-inner\">\n    <p class=\"hs-hero-eyebrow\">Hundred Hyper Series &nbsp;·&nbsp; Cricket Shoes 2025</p>\n    <h1 class=\"hs-hero-headline\">\n      <span class=\"hs-col-drive\">Hyper</span><br>\n      <span class=\"hs-outline\">Drive</span>&nbsp;<span style=\"color:rgba(245,243,239,0.15)\">/</span>&nbsp;<span class=\"hs-col-turf\">Turf</span>\n    </h1>\n    <p class=\"hs-hero-sub\">Two weapons. One mission — dominate every pitch, every surface, every match. Engineered with HexaFoam technology and TerraSpike outsoles.</p>\n    <div class=\"hs-hero-price\">\n      <span class=\"hs-price-strike\">₹2,499</span>\n      <span class=\"hs-price-main\">₹1,599</span>\n      <span class=\"hs-price-sub\">Both models &nbsp;·&nbsp; Free shipping across India</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"hs-hero-actions\">\n      <a href=\"#hs-products\" class=\"hs-btn-primary\">Choose Your Shoe</a>\n      <a href=\"#hs-compare\" class=\"hs-btn-secondary\">Drive vs Turf →</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>",
